# AI-Server: Unified Lab Management Platform — Design & Implementation Plan

A full-stack, role-based lab management platform built for internal lab teams. Features include scheduling, inventory, Kanban task boards, wishlists, dashboards with Gantt/pie charts, weekly reporting with PDF export, and Discord notifications.

---

## System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    Browser["Browser (React SPA)"]
    Nginx["Nginx Reverse Proxy"]
    Backend["NestJS API + WebSocket Gateway"]
    Postgres["PostgreSQL DB"]
    Discord["Discord Webhooks"]
    Uploads["File Upload Storage (local or S3)"]

    Browser -- HTTPS --> Nginx
    Nginx -- /api --> Backend
    Nginx -- / --> Browser
    Backend -- SQL --> Postgres
    Backend -- axios POST --> Discord
    Backend -- fs / S3 --> Uploads
```

**Key decisions:**
- **NestJS** (TypeScript) over plain Express: built-in modules, Guards, Decorators, and Pipes make RBAC, validation, and testability cleaner. Can be extracted to microservices later.
- **Monorepo** layout: `frontend/` + `backend/` in one Git repo for MVP simplicity.
- **PostgreSQL** with `pg` / TypeORM for structured relational data.
- **Socket.io** integrated via NestJS Gateways for real-time dashboard updates.
- **JWT** (access token 15min, refresh token 7d, stored in httpOnly cookie).

