## REST API Endpoints

### Auth
| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Login, returns access+refresh JWTs |
| POST | `/api/auth/refresh` | Public | Refresh access token |
| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | Auth | Invalidate refresh token |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Auth | Current user profile |
| POST | `/api/auth/reset-password` | Public | Request password reset email |

### Users (Admin only for CRUD)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/users` | List all users |
| POST | `/api/users` | Create user |
| PATCH | `/api/users/:id` | Update user/role |
| DELETE | `/api/users/:id` | Deactivate user |

### Schedules
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/schedules` | Employee submits shifts for a week |
| GET | `/api/schedules?week=YYYY-MM-DD` | Get all schedules for a week (Manager+) |
| GET | `/api/schedules/mine` | Employee's own schedules |
| POST | `/api/schedules/post-discord/:weekStart` | Admin: push unified schedule to Discord |

### Inventory
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/inventory` | Search/filter items |
| POST | `/api/inventory` | Add item (Inventory_Manager+) |
| PATCH | `/api/inventory/:id` | Edit item (Inventory_Manager+) |
| DELETE | `/api/inventory/:id` | Delete item (Admin) |
| POST | `/api/inventory/:id/checkout` | Log check-out |
| POST | `/api/inventory/:id/checkin` | Log check-in |
| GET | `/api/inventory/:id/logs` | View check-in/out history |
| POST | `/api/inventory/:id/upload` | Upload photo |

### Projects & Tasks
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/projects` | List projects |
| POST | `/api/projects` | Create project (Manager+) |
| PATCH | `/api/projects/:id` | Update project |
| GET | `/api/tasks?project=&assignee=&status=` | Filter tasks |
| POST | `/api/tasks` | Create task |
| PATCH | `/api/tasks/:id` | Update task (status, assignee, etc.) |
| DELETE | `/api/tasks/:id` | Delete task (Manager+) |
| POST | `/api/tasks/:id/attachment` | Upload file attachment |

### Wishlists
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/wishlists?project=` | List wishlist items |
| POST | `/api/wishlists` | Add item |
| PATCH | `/api/wishlists/:id` | Update (approve/reject by Manager) |
| DELETE | `/api/wishlists/:id` | Delete item |
| GET | `/api/wishlists/budget/:projectId` | Budget summary (spent vs. total) |

### Weekly Reports
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/reports` | Employee submits report |
| PATCH | `/api/reports/:id` | Update draft |
| GET | `/api/reports/mine` | My own reports |
| GET | `/api/reports?week=&userId=` | Admin: all reports |
| GET | `/api/reports/export/pdf?week=` | Admin: export weekly PDF |
| POST | `/api/reports/remind/:weekStart` | Admin: send Discord reminders |

### Dashboard
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/dashboard/summary` | Aggregated stats (open tasks, inventory alerts, etc.) |
| GET | `/api/dashboard/gantt?projectId=` | Task timeline for Gantt |
| GET | `/api/dashboard/my` | Personal dashboard (my tasks, schedule, hours) |

