## RBAC Permission Matrix

| Feature | Admin | Manager | Employee | Inventory_Manager |
|---------|-------|---------|----------|-------------------|
| Create/edit users | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| View all schedules | ✅ | ✅ | Own only | ✅ |
| Post schedule to Discord | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Add/edit inventory | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| View inventory | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Create projects/tasks | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Update task status | ✅ | ✅ | Own assigned | ❌ |
| View all reports | ✅ | ✅ | Own only | ❌ |
| Export PDF reports | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Send Discord reminders | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |

